+/* ################## Ethernet peripheral configuration ##################### */
+
+/* Section 1 : Ethernet peripheral configuration */
+
+/* MAC ADDRESS: MAC_ADDR0:MAC_ADDR1:MAC_ADDR2:MAC_ADDR3:MAC_ADDR4:MAC_ADDR5 */
